# Production-only build variables.
#
# Astro exposes `PUBLIC_`-prefixed variables to the browser; anything without
# that prefix stays server-side. The AdSense publisher ID is public by design —
# it ships in the page source and in ads.txt — so `PUBLIC_` is correct here.
#
# Secrets (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY) must NEVER live in this
# file. Set those in Cloudflare → Workers & Pages → tilershub → Variables & Secrets.

PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT=ca-pub-1872998397981052
